man in "},{"t":"judgment","s":["H4941"],"a":[7]},{"t":"."}]},{"n":6,"text":"A fool’s lips bring strife, And his mouth invites blows.","tok":[{"t":"A "},{"t":"fool’s","s":["H3684"],"a":[1]},{"t":" "},{"t":"lips","s":["H8193"],"a":[0]},{"t":" bring strife, And his "},{"t":"mouth","s":["H6310"],"a":[4]},{"t":" invites blows."}]},{"n":7,"text":"A fool’s mouth is his ruin, And his lips are the snare of his soul.","tok":[{"t":"A "},{"t":"fool’s","s":["H3684"],"a":[1]},{"t":" "},{"t":"mouth","s":["H6310"],"a":[0]},{"t":" is his ruin, And his "},{"t":"lips","s":["H8193"],"a":[4]},{"t":" are the "},{"t":"snare","s":["H4170"],"a":[5]},{"t":" of his "},{"t":"soul","s":["H5315"],"a":[6]},{"t":"."}]},{"n":8,"text":"The words of a whisperer are like dainty morsels, And they go down into the innermost parts of one’s being.","tok":[{"t":"The "},{"t":"words","s":["H1697"],"a":[0]},{"t":" of a whisperer are like dainty morsels, And they go "},{"t":"down","s":["H3381"],"a":[4]},{"t":" into the innermost "},{"t":"parts","s":["H2315"],"a":[5]},{"t":" of one’s being."}]},{"n":9,"text":"He also who is slack in his work Is brother to him who is a destroyer.","tok":[{"t":"He also who is slack in his "},{"t":"work","s":["H4399"],"a":[2]},{"t":" Is "},{"t":"brother","s":["H0251"],"a":[3]},{"t":" to him who is a destroyer."}]},{"n":10,"text":"The name of Jehovah is a strong tower; The righteous man runs into it and is safe.","tok":[{"t":"The "},{"t":"name","s":["H8034"],"a":[2]},{"t":" of "},{"t":"Jehovah","s":["H3068"],"a":[3]},{"t":" is a "},{"t":"strong","s":["H5797"],"a":[1]},{"t":" "},{"t":"tower","s":["H4026"],"a":[0]},{"t":"; The "},{"t":"righteous","s":["H6662"],"a":[6]},{"t":" man runs into it and is "},{"t":"safe","s":["H7682"],"a":[7]},{"t":"."}]},{"n":11,"text":"The rich man’s substance is his strong city And like a high wall in his own imagination.","tok":[{"t":"The rich "},{"t":"man’s","s":["H6223"],"a":[1]},{"t":" substance is his "},{"t":"strong","s":["H5797"],"a":[3]},{"t":" "